<title>USA: Yahoo! sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Yahoo! sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yahoo! Inc. Tuesday said its Board of Directors approved a three-for-two common stock split.</p>
<p>Shareholders of record on August 11, 1997 will be entitled to one additional share for every two shares held on that date.</p>
